    "inputs": {
      "value": "SCENE 2 — CRAWLING THE WEB\n\n<Picture 1> defines <Subject 1> and is the absolute authority for identity and character design. Preserve the same female character design exactly. Preserve the exact hairstyle or hair state shown in <Picture 1>. Do not add, remove, shorten, lengthen, recolor, or redesign the hair.\n\nRender the complete scene in the same simple nostalgic hand-drawn 2D Japanese family-anime style.\n\nNo photorealism.\nNo 3D graphics.\nNo realistic computer interface.\nNo mixed visual styles.\n\n0:00-0:03:\nHard cut from the previous black screen back into the anime studio.\n\nA large illustrated web page floats beside the presenter.\n\nThe web page contains exactly THREE distinct text blocks.\n\nText blocks from top to bottom:\n\nAPPLE PIE\nSMART PHONES\nFRESH APPLES\n\nThere are exactly THREE horizontal document icons beneath the text.\n\n<Subject 1> points specifically at the APPLE PIE and FRESH APPLES blocks.\n\n<Subject 1> says:\n<d>[English, Neutral British Female Voice] Suppose you only want to find web pages about apples.</d>\n\n0:03-0:06:\nFast punch-in toward the floating page.\n\nThe APPLE PIE block glows with a pale yellow outline.\n\nThe FRESH APPLES block glows with a pale yellow outline.\n\nThe SMART PHONES block becomes slightly faded.\n\nDirectly beneath the page, exact white text appears:\n\nFIND \"Apples\"\n\n<Subject 1> says:\n<d>[English, Neutral British Female Voice] A crawler reads billions of pages to find your exact word.</d>\n\n0:06-0:10:\nThe page slides upward.\n\nA second exact line appears directly underneath the first:\n\nSAVE TO INDEX;\n\nThe final two-line query must read exactly:\n\nFIND \"Apples\"\nSAVE TO INDEX;\n\nA small hand-drawn arrow travels from the text toward a database icon.\n\n<Subject 1> says:\n<d>[English, Neutral British Female Voice] It then saves the exact location of that word into a database.</d>\n\nThe camera quickly pushes toward the database to transition into the next scene."
    },
    "class_type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
    "_meta": {
      "title": "Input Text Prompt"
    }
